# ==============================================================================
# MLOHUB ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ==============================================================================
# STRICT RUNTIME BOUNDARY & CLIENT SECURITY RULES:
#
# 1. Variables prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ are bundled directly into the client
#    application bundle (accessible to any mobile or web user).
#
# 2. ONLY the public endpoint and anon/publishable key may be exposed:
#    - EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_ENV
#    - EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
#    - EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#
# 3. RUNTIME ENVIRONMENT MODES:
#    - development -> local/real Supabase (e.g., http://127.0.0.1:54321).
#                     NO fake DB fallback allowed. Fails closed if unconfigured.
#    - test        -> automated test runners (tsx tests/runAllSuites.ts).
#                     Mock adapters and offline test fixtures permitted.
#    - demo        -> explicit interactive showcase/demo sandbox.
#                     Demo UI accounts and offline fixtures permitted.
#    - staging     -> hosted staging Supabase required (https://<project>.supabase.co).
#                     Strict fail-closed if missing or placeholder.
#    - production  -> hosted production Supabase required (https://<project>.supabase.co).
#                     Strict fail-closed; zero client fallbacks permitted.
#
# 4. CRITICAL SERVER SECRETS (MUST NEVER BE CLIENT VARIABLES):
#    The following variables MUST NEVER have an EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix:
#    - SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   (Trusted database administrative key)
#    - SMS_OTP_PEPPER              (Cryptographic pepper for HMAC-SHA256 OTPs)
#    - Payment provider secrets    (CLICKPESA_API_KEY, CLICKPESA_CLIENT_ID, etc.)
#    - Webhook secrets             (CLICKPESA_WEBHOOK_SECRET)
#    - Database passwords          (PostgreSQL direct connection strings)
#    These belong EXCLUSIVELY in Supabase Edge Function environment settings.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT-SAFE VARIABLES (Expo / React Native)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EXPO_PUBLIC_APP_ENV=development
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_LOCAL_PUBLISHABLE_KEY

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY VARIABLES (Supabase Edge Functions / Backend Secrets)
# NEVER expose to client bundles with EXPO_PUBLIC_ prefix!
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
# SMS_OTP_PEPPER=
# SMS_PROVIDER=sandbox
# NEXTSMS_USERNAME=
# NEXTSMS_PASSWORD=
# NEXTSMS_SENDER_ID=MLOHUB
# BEEM_API_KEY=
# BEEM_SECRET_KEY=
# BEEM_SENDER_ID=INFO
# PAYMENT_PROVIDER=sandbox
# CLICKPESA_BASE_URL=https://sandbox.clickpesa.com/v1
# CLICKPESA_CLIENT_ID=
# CLICKPESA_API_KEY=
# CLICKPESA_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
